# Publish, update or retire content

Content goes out of date. A label that was right for last year’s integration may be wrong now. This section says how to publish, change and remove content, including this guide.

| Page | Use it to |
| --- | --- |
| [Choose a content type](choose-content-type.html) | Pick the right format and record who owns it |
| [Publish](publish.html) | Check content before it goes live |
| [Update](update.html) | Change content and say what changed |
| [Retire](retire.html) | Remove content without leaving people stuck |
